       "narratives with citations  \n",
       "• <span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Data needed:</span> secure retrieval over claims content + SIU artifacts; integration to case mgmt tools  \n",
       "• <span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Controls:</span> mandatory citations; restricted action set; red-team for hallucinations; secure prompt/data handling\n",
       "\n",
       "\n",
       "<span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Pragmatic “best first bets” sequence (typical for large carriers)</span>  \n",
       "<span style=\"color: #008080; text-decoration-color: #008080; font-weight: bold\">1</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">)</span> <span style=\"font-weight: bold\">LLM/NLP triage summary + entity extraction</span> <span style=\"font-weight: bold\">(</span>low risk, immediate productivity<span style=\"font-weight: bold\">)</span>  \n",
       "<span style=\"color: #008080; text-decoration-color: #008080; font-weight: bold\">2</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">)</span> <span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Duplicate/related claim detection</span> <span style=\"font-weight: bold\">(</span>quick leakage capture<span style=\"font-weight: bold\">)</span>  \n",
